OL,3,GNEWSAWarning as abnormal load hits West
OL,4,Amotorways
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists have been warned there could
OL,7,Fbe more than six hours of potential
OL,8,Fmotorway disruption due to an abnormal
OL,9,Fload being moved by police.
OL,11,FA convoy of large vehicles transporting
OL,12,Fhuge industrial structures left
OL,13,FAvonmouth Dock, near Bristol, at about
OL,14,F09:00 BST on Saturday.
OL,16,FAvon and Somerset Police said it
OL,17,Fexpected it would take six-and-a-half
OL,18,Fhours to transport the load on the M5,
OL,19,FM32 and M4 through Wiltshire to Didcot
OL,20,FPower Station in Oxfordshire.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
