OL,3,GNEWSAWarning as abnormal load hits West
OL,4,Amotorways
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the force said the
OL,7,Fconvoy would cause "disruption" and
OL,8,Fapologised for the inconvenience
OL,9,Fcaused, urging drivers to find
OL,10,Falternative routes where possible.
